# k.units/shards/currency-words: the minor units of 41 currencies (cent, penny/pence, ban/bani ...) and the everyday words of 21: slang (buck, quid, greenback), symbols and codes as words, and the usual reading of a unit word said alone (dollar: the US dollar; pound: the pound sterling, not the pound of mass; leu, lei: the Romanian leu). The wires merge with those of the shard currencies.
# sources: hand-core 1 (written in this repository: tools/import/currencies.mjs MINOR and WORDS)
# license: CC0-1.0
# script: tools/import/currencies.mjs

